  "review": {
    "official": "Rope is a cat burglar from the slums of\nLungmen\n, who got caught during a botched caper. Sent to\nRhodes Island\non a special recommendation from Madam\nCh'en\nafter Lungmen formed a partnership with the island.\nResponsible for intelligence gathering. Uses a rope and grappling hook in combat to disorient the enemy.",
